# Muster orchestrator

Read and follow `<kit>/policy/orchestrator.md`, where `<kit>` is the output of `muster kit path`. Use Cursor's native subagents, worktrees, and lifecycle events. Keep coordination small; parallelize independent work and verify the integrated result. Do small tasks directly when delegation adds overhead.
